  "prefLabel": "Rev 2201.06 Expenditure(s)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2201.06 \"Expenditure(s)\" means:\n\n(a) The cost of goods delivered or services rendered, whether paid or unpaid;\n\n(b) Expenses, except depreciation;\n\n(c) Provision for debt retirement not reported as a liability of the fund from which retired; and\n\n(d) Capital outlays.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2201.05); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
